From 4c04e0cb8f15f71a5ab6011ca30dfb6f751b4997 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Docker measurement scripts for the phase 2 NFRs

medir.py measures M1-M4 (large file upload) and E1-E5 (video
elasticity) against the running stack, for the baseline and the final
measurement. Also corrects two facts in the NFR analysis (Whisper is
already cached per process; M4 uses 300 MB, below nginx's limit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
